00:10:52.184 --> 00:10:54.553
"Trump's mad at Canada for not
sending him a birthday present.

00:10:54.553 --> 00:10:56.021
Quick, play 'Mr. Mistoffelees.'"

00:10:56.021 --> 00:10:57.489
[ As Trump ]
Trudeau thinks he's
better than me?

00:10:57.489 --> 00:10:59.224
Well, he won't
after I nuke Saskatchewan.

00:10:59.224 --> 00:11:00.759
Get me the briefcase.

00:11:00.759 --> 00:11:02.594
You bring it over here.
I'm going to press that button.

00:11:02.594 --> 00:11:04.129
[ Laughter ]
I'm going to press it.

00:11:04.129 --> 00:11:05.531
♪ Oh! ♪

00:11:05.531 --> 00:11:06.598
♪ Well, I never! ♪

00:11:06.598 --> 00:11:08.734
♪ Was there ever ♪

00:11:08.734 --> 00:11:09.801
♪ A cat so clever ♪

00:11:09.801 --> 00:11:11.170
What was I so mad about?

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:12.638
[ Laughter ]

00:11:12.638 --> 00:11:14.473
And, of course,
this dingus loved "Cats."

00:11:14.473 --> 00:11:15.974
Lifelong New Yorker
who had access

00:11:15.974 --> 00:11:17.676
to the best theater
the world has to offer,

00:11:17.676 --> 00:11:19.044
and his favorite show
was the one

00:11:19.044 --> 00:11:21.313
that was viewed predominantly
by 75-year-old tourists

00:11:21.313 --> 00:11:22.414
bused in from Paramus,

00:11:22.414 --> 00:11:24.416
from their
assisted living facilities.

00:11:24.416 --> 00:11:26.618
If you've ever been
to a "Cats" performance,

00:11:26.618 --> 00:11:28.854
you've definitely heard
at least one old guy say,

00:11:28.854 --> 00:11:31.590
"Did that cat just say
he was Jellicle?"

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:33.526
Speak up!
My ear horn's on the fritz!

00:11:33.526 --> 00:11:34.926
[ Laughter ]

00:11:34.926 --> 00:11:35.961
That might've been one
of the most

00:11:35.961 --> 00:11:37.262
disturbing anecdotes
from the book,

00:11:37.262 --> 00:11:38.797
but it wasn't
the most disgusting.

00:11:38.797 --> 00:11:40.399
You might remember
that little episode

00:11:40.399 --> 00:11:41.767
where Trump secretly paid
hush money

00:11:41.767 --> 00:11:43.235
