00:11:47.873 --> 00:11:49.341
[ As Toad ]
♪ Memory ♪

00:11:49.341 --> 00:11:50.442
[ Laughter ]

00:11:50.442 --> 00:11:54.112
♪ All alone in the moonlight ♪

00:11:54.112 --> 00:11:55.914
Anyway, Grisham also says,
in her book, that,

00:11:55.914 --> 00:11:58.283
after Stormy Daniels said that,
Trump called Grisham

00:11:58.283 --> 00:12:00.119
