to refute the story.

00:12:00.119 --> 00:12:01.453 line:0%
-Grisham claims that Trump tried

00:12:01.453 --> 00:12:03.822 line:0%
to assure her that his...

00:12:03.822 --> 00:12:06.591 line:0%
equipment was normal
after Stormy Daniels

00:12:06.591 --> 00:12:10.362 line:0%
described it as a character
in "Super Mario Bros."

00:12:10.362 --> 00:12:12.498
-Normally, when someone
makes a call from a plane,

00:12:12.498 --> 00:12:14.400
it's to say something like,
"We just landed,"

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:16.335
or "Tell Grandma
I'll be there soon,"

00:12:16.335 --> 00:12:17.903
not, "That porn star was lying

00:12:17.903 --> 00:12:20.072
and my doink doesn't look
like a Nintendo character."

00:12:20.072 --> 00:12:21.173
[ Laughter ]
So, to recap,

00:12:21.173 --> 00:12:22.341
the president
of the United States

00:12:22.341 --> 00:12:24.309
used a secure phone line,
relayed through like

00:12:24.309 --> 00:12:25.778
seven different satellites,
with some

00:12:25.778 --> 00:12:27.612
of the most sophisticated
technology in the world,

00:12:27.612 --> 00:12:30.082
to tell his White House aide
that his penis wasn't weird.

00:12:30.082 --> 00:12:32.518
I'd like to think
