00:12:36.188 --> 00:12:38.089
[ Laughter ]

00:12:38.089 --> 00:12:39.491
And that's what it looked like.

00:12:39.491 --> 00:12:41.427
[ Laughter ]
This is what we're facing,

00:12:41.427 --> 00:12:43.395
